
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Tiny AI World</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #171b18;
      color: #fff4df;
    }

    header {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 32px 16px;
      background: #29392e;
    }

    header h1 {
      font-size: 32px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    header p {
      color: #d6e0cf;
    }

    main {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: auto;
      padding: 20px;
    }

    .videos {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .card {
      background: #273029;
      border-radius: 14px;
      overflow: hidden;
      padding-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .cover {
      min-height: 145px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      font-size: 55px;
      background: #455b47;
    }

    .card h2, .card p, .card a {
      margin-left: 16px;
      margin-right: 16px;
    }

    .card a {
      display: inline-block;
      color: #f3d39a;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 24px;
      color: #c6c6b9;
    }

    @media (min-width: 600px) {
      .videos {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>🌿 Tiny AI World</h1>
    <p>Small worlds. Cozy moments. Endless wonder.</p>
  </header>

  <main>
    <h2>✨ Explore Our Miniature Worlds</h2>

    <section class="videos">
      <article class="card">
        <div class="cover">🍵</div>
        <h2>Tiny Tea Garden</h2>
        <p>A peaceful little garden full of tiny details.</p>
        <a href="#tea">Watch video →</a>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <div class="cover">🏮</div>
        <h2>Mini Night Market</h2>
        <p>A cozy miniature street filled with warm lights.</p>
        <a href="#market">Watch video →</a>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <div class="cover">🎹</div>
        <h2>Vintage Music Room</h2>
        <p>A tiny room made for quiet and relaxing moments.</p>
        <a href="#music">Watch video →</a>
      </article>
    </section>

    <p id="tea">Tea Garden video: coming soon.</p>
    <p id="market">Night Market video: coming soon.</p>
    <p id="music">Music Room video: coming soon.</p>
  </main>

  <footer>
    © 2026 Tiny AI World · Made with imagination
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
